item.description:
Aggression contrasted with Affiliative
Konrad Lorenz describes &ldquo;controlled form of aggression&rdquo;
Inspiried by Oliver Double&rsquo;s book Getting the joke There are three primary modes of aggressive humour, and they&rsquo;re subjectively perceived as:

Diacope Repetition, with a word or two between &ldquo;Bond, James Bond&rdquo;
Villiam, damned smiling villain.
to be or not to be

truth in fiction
Wasp attack inspired Coraline Returning was scarier than Imitating other writers
Every young writer imitates their heroes, but also take inspiration from other sources: song, poem, myths, etc&hellip;
